  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Trace Protocol Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Trace Protocol Project by ELEVATE seeks to increase downstream tracing of goods made by child labor and forced labor. The project is designed to address the barriersin supply chain traceability, and result in the development and sharing of open, accessible and replicable tools that can advance the knowledge base on supply chain tracing and scale the adoption of traceability solutions by various actors in different sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
